# OmniCharge Enterprise Upgrade Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Upgrade the OmniCharge platform architecture by implementing an Event-Driven Saga Pattern using **RabbitMQ** (replacing synchronous inter-service HTTP calls), adopting the **CQRS Pattern** with **Redis** for read-model scaling, and integrating **Razorpay** for production-ready payment processing.

---

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Common Library (`omnicharge-common`)
We will create structured event classes for the Saga pattern and update dependencies to support Razorpay.
#### [MODIFY] `pom.xml`
- No major changes here unless we lift DTOs.
#### [NEW] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/common/event/saga/*`
- `RechargeInitiatedEvent.java`
- `PaymentApprovedEvent.java`
- `PaymentRejectedEvent.java`
- `RefundPaymentCommand.java`

### 2. Payment Service (Razorpay Integration & Saga Participant)
Transition the service from exposing a synchronous REST endpoint to consuming RabbitMQ messages, and replace Stripe with Razorpay.
#### [MODIFY] `pom.xml`
- Add `razorpay-java` dependency.
#### [NEW] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/payment/service/RazorpayPaymentService.java`
- Logic to integrate with Razorpay: `razorpayClient.orders.create(...)` and handle payment intent.
#### [MODIFY] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/payment/consumer/PaymentSagaConsumer.java`
- Listen to RabbitMQ queue `saga.payment.process`.
- Read `RechargeInitiatedEvent`, process Razorpay order, save Transaction logic.
- Publish `PaymentApprovedEvent` or `PaymentRejectedEvent` to RabbitMQ.
#### [MODIFY] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/payment/config/RabbitMQConfig.java`
- Declare routing keys and topic bindings for `saga.payment.*` arrays.

### 3. Recharge Service (Saga Orchestrator)
Remove synchronous Feign coupling and implement Orchestrator state limits via messaging.
#### [MODIFY] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/recharge/service/RechargeService.java`
- Remove `PaymentServiceClient` feign call.
- Upon recharge, save status as `PENDING` and publish `RechargeInitiatedEvent` to RabbitMQ.
#### [NEW] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/recharge/consumer/RechargeSagaConsumer.java`
- Listen to `saga.recharge.approved` and `saga.recharge.rejected`.
- **Approved**: Transition recharge status to `SUCCESS` in DB, publish `RechargeCompletedEvent` for Notification Svc.
- **Rejected**: Transition to `FAILED`.
#### [MODIFY] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/recharge/client/PaymentServiceClient.java`
- Removed.

### 4. Operator Service (CQRS with Redis)
Decouple commands from queries.
#### [MODIFY] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/operator/service/PlanService.java` -> `PlanCommandService`
- Handle writes (MySQL save) and broadcast `PlanUpdatedEvent` over RabbitMQ.
#### [NEW] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/operator/service/PlanQueryService.java`
- Reads entirely from Redis.
#### [NEW] `src/main/java/com/omnicharge/operator/consumer/RedisProjector.java`
- Listens to `PlanUpdatedEvent` and instantly syncs JSON to Redis schemas.

### 5. Config Server
Centralize RabbitMQ orchestrator topics.
#### [MODIFY] configurations 
- Add `razorpay.key_id` and `razorpay.key_secret` to `payment-service.properties`.

